              <div className="mt-2 p-4 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-xl animate-pop">
                 <p className="text-xs text-indigo-900 font-bold mb-2">💡 아래 주소 형식에서 하이라이트된 부분이 ID입니다.</p>
                 <div className="bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 break-all">
                   docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<span className="bg-yellow-200 text-black px-1 font-bold">1A2b3C4d5E6f...</span>/edit
